<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "togisuma.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\警察署受付.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN><STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> and I had returned to the police station and, for several hours, kept waiting to see whether any information on <STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE> would come in.<PG>
After that, the police had searched the surrounding area, but neither <STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE> nor <STYLE ID="3">Obasan</STYLE> had been found.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
According to <STYLE ID="4">Ise-san</STYLE>, no sign of entry into any floor partway down during the fall.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Right at the place thought to be the landing point, fresh footprints thought to have been left with great force.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The car owned by the Niimura family, missing as well.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In other words, apparently it was thought that they really had jumped from the 5th floor and fled by car.<PG>
But at first, jumping from the 5th floor was unthinkable, and in the beginning the search had concentrated on the area around the apartment building.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So putting a cordon around the whole Motoki-cho area had been delayed, and the car's whereabouts, unknown too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
On that part, <STYLE ID="4">Ise-san</STYLE> too regretted having made an error of judgment.<PG>
However, if you jumped off the roof of a five-story apartment building, there was no way you would come away unhurt.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At that moment, I remembered the spiriting-away theory of the Megasawa City case.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, I'm sure </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> is safe."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Yeah... there's no way </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Obasan</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> would lay a hand on </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\警察署時計.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Before long, April 8 would be over.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The anniversary of <STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE>'s dad's death... and, starting today, the anniversary of <STYLE ID="6">my dad</STYLE>'s death as well.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
I closed my eyes, and put my hands together.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At the very least, just praying like this for the two of them to rest in peace...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What I can do before April 8 ends is only this much.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\警察署受付.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島横顔.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "100" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島合掌.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "500" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
When I opened my eyes, <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> too had closed her eyes in the same way and put her hands together.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\シナリオ\000過去へ馳せる夢\時計11回.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "5000" "PASS"}
{MESON "500"}
The time signal announcing midnight―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This sound, it's the same as the clock at <STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE>'s home...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But I'll never hear this sound at <STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE>'s home again.<PG>
No, <STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE> will surely come back.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE> will surely come back to me.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物2" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">... that letter...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Letter?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">　What do you mean?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"I don't know anything. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, you too... you don't know anything, right...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "ネジの壊れたロボット.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "900" "0"}
About that letter, no one knew except me, <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="7">Mom</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Maybe, it could turn out to be a clue to finding <STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE>.<PG>
But apparently if that goes to the police, <STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE> and I will both be erased from society. Yet that isn't what I'm afraid of.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If it were made public, I would lose even more people dear to me. That was the feeling I had.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ母.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
Just then, someone dear to me, <STYLE ID="7">Mom</STYLE>, appeared.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">... </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">Mom</STYLE>'s face was even more haggard.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Held by the police for hours already, and on top of that, her best friend, <STYLE ID="3">Obasan</STYLE>, gone missing.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">Mom</STYLE>'s state of mind, too, was probably close to its limit by now.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島考えるバストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Obasan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, are you all right? Just now, I was talking about the letter with </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島挨拶バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Your letter the other day, </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, it was fun! But the letters from me, please put them somewhere people won't find them!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
With that, <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> grinned.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> and I had never exchanged any letters. This was a blatant lie of <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE>'s.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
Hearing that, <STYLE ID="7">Mom</STYLE>'s expression did not change.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"I'm just... going to get some air outside..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物2" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="7">Mom</STYLE> walked out of the police station with heavy steps.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When I turned my eyes to <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE>, the smile from before was gone.<PG>
I know why <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> said a thing like that.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That letter, <STYLE ID="7">Mom</STYLE> must have read it too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So, <STYLE ID="7">Mom</STYLE> must know what lies behind this incident.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">Mom</STYLE> knew something was going to happen, and yet, without even stopping it―<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE>'s lie just now is her greatest protest against <STYLE ID="7">Mom</STYLE>, and her anger.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even so, <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> had shown me the utmost consideration.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"I'll forget about that letter too. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">But the intent behind </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Obasan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> putting that letter away somewhere it could be found right away if anyone looked for it, you understand it, don't you...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At last, I understood.<PG>
I hadn't really understood the circumstances of <STYLE ID="7">Mom</STYLE> coming to the police station first, but so that was what it meant.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">Mom</STYLE>, if anything happened, had meant to make that letter public.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">Mom</STYLE> had already, by now, steeled herself for something.<PG>
But for me and <STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE>, she still hadn't made it public.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I don't know the reason yet, but if she's acting in such a contradictory way, <STYLE ID="7">Mom</STYLE> must be in considerable anguish, even now.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> saying something that <STYLE ID="8" RUBY="さかな">rubbed</STYLE> that the wrong way means her anger at <STYLE ID="7">Mom</STYLE> must be considerable.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島横顔.gal" "WAIT" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">... I'm sorry... To </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Obasan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, something that awful... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">But... I'll apologize, but I won't regret it."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE>, like <STYLE ID="7">Mom</STYLE>, was in anguish too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Her anger at <STYLE ID="7">Mom</STYLE>, and her feelings for me, must be clashing violently inside <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE>.
{CREATECG "リファレンス解禁画像" "グラフィック\システム\リファレンス解禁画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "189" "600" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, what's going to happen to her..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"At best, turning herself in. In the worst case―"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"All right, you don't have to say any more."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What is this...!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Turning herself in, what does that mean! The worst case, what does that mean!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">Mom</STYLE>, did you do something!?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">Dad</STYLE>, did you do something you had to be killed for!?<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE>, and <STYLE ID="6">Dad</STYLE>, and <STYLE ID="7">Mom</STYLE>, all of them disappear from in front of me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Why is it always the people dear to me...!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Maybe, even I myself, sooner or later―<PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">... will I, too, disappear...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"It's all right, I'll stay by your side, no matter what...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Really...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"It's thanks to my </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">senpais</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> that I am who I am now. So... if even you were gone, </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">what would happen to me... Probably, my heart would break..."</STYLE><PG>
Inside <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE>, there seemed to be a self-protective streak that still had something childish about it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That was probably also among <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE>'s reasons for not making that letter public.<PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"Yeah, it's okay, I'll be by your side too, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">. </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, you're not alone either, okay?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Thank you. I really, without you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">―"</STYLE><PG>
{CHGVOL "BGM" "700" "3000" "PASS"}
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\アスファルトダッシュ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "VOICE" "1000" "3000" "WAIT"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "1000" "WAIT"}
{MESON "500"}
A woman came into the police station.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Someone I had never seen before...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\桃子.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="9">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Erina</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\椅子から立つ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This person is <STYLE ID="9">Goto's older sister</STYLE>...?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I had heard about her, but this was the first time I'd met her.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But I'd been told she didn't get along with <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE>...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\桃子五島抱きしめる.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1,人物2" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Siiis</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">! </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, she...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> threw her arms around <STYLE ID="9">her sister</STYLE> and began to cry like a kindergartner.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"Geez... still a kid, no matter how much time goes by..."</STYLE><PG>
I see... It wasn't that they really got along badly. They had only been a little out of step with each other...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Along with the relief, I felt just a tiny bit lonely.<PG>
{MESOFF "0"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">... I'll be waiting..."</STYLE>
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "エンド画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\lcm\ルートエンド.lcm" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAITPLAY "000" "CLICK"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
